      "content": "hey, i have this insane toothache from a cavity and i cant sleep at all. i have some tylenol but it barely does anything when i take the normal dose. if i take like 4 or 5 of the extra strength ones at once, will that help me finally knock out for the night? i just really need the pain to stop.",
