      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but i cant get to a dentist until monday and im literally losing my mind here. i know it says not to go crazy but what is the actual limit? like how much can i safely take at one time so it actually works for the pain? i just need to know if 3000mg or 4000mg in one go is okay so i can just sleep.",
